# Secretion Protein & Secretion Channel Prediction

**Thesis project:** ML/DL classifiers for predicting bacterial secretion 
system effector types (T1SE–T6SE) and secretion channel/system types 
(T1SS–T6SS) from protein sequence data.

Part of the **HYDROCOW** project.

---

